@startuml
title Activity 01 - Login and 2FA (risk-based authentication style)
start
|CustomerApp|
:Open login page;
:Enter username/password;
|AuthAPI|
:Validate credentials;
if (Credentials valid?) then (yes)
  :Create AUTH_SESSION;
else (no)
  :Show invalid credential error;
  stop
endif
|AuthAPI|
:Evaluate device trust and geolocation;
if (Trusted device?) then (yes)
  :Require OTP only;
else (no)
  :Require OTP + device challenge;
endif
|NotificationService|
:Send OTP/Push challenge;
|CustomerApp|
:Submit challenge response;
|AuthAPI|
:Verify OTP_CHALLENGE;
if (Challenge passed?) then (yes)
  :Issue access token;
else (no)
  :Increment failed attempts;
  if (Max attempts reached?) then (yes)
    :Lock AUTH_SESSION;
    stop
  else (no)
    :Prompt retry;
  endif
endif
fork
|FraudEngine|
:Score login risk and update profile;
fork again
|NotificationService|
:Send login-success alert;
fork again
|AuthAPI|
:Load ACCOUNT snapshot;
end fork
|CustomerApp|
:Render dashboard;
stop
@enduml
